# The mouse camera (port/p0/mouse_camera.c, docs/CONTROLS.md): New Game as tests/interp-walk.input (Start, then A
# through the opening's messages to VI 1200), then in the throne room: zoom out, a slow turn right, look down, walk
# up the stick (relative to the view), reset (middle click), walk again, quicker turns (orbit pictures between ticks),
# zoom in. `mouse VI DX DY WHEEL FLAGS` rows: turn counts (0.006 rad across, 0.004 up and down), wheel steps
# (+ in), flags 1 = reset.
